//
// Result: [ ] No anomalous password reset activity detected — volume and initiator pattern appears consistent with normal operations
//         [ ] Results found — see findings below
//
// Findings:
//   Initiating account:
//   Target account(s):
//   Self-service or admin-initiated:
//   Timeframe:
//   Notes:
